WEBVTT

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:07.359
The Library page shows the folders of the site on the left, starting

00:00:07.359 --> 00:00:09.590
with the root folder, named Files.

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:14.090
On the right, a table lists the files of the selected folder, with

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:17.826
their name, the date they were last modified, and their size.

00:00:18.283 --> 00:00:21.697
The toolbar above the table has a button with a grid icon.

00:00:21.697 --> 00:00:25.590
It switches the table to a grid of thumbnails, so you can recognize

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:26.923
images at a glance.

00:00:27.382 --> 00:00:29.544
Press it again to return to the table.

00:00:29.544 --> 00:00:33.722
The search box narrows the list to the files whose name contains what you type.

00:00:34.194 --> 00:00:38.593
Upload files adds files to the selected folder, and you can also drop

00:00:38.593 --> 00:00:40.118
files onto the page.

00:00:40.118 --> 00:00:44.634
A file needs an allowed extension and must not exceed the maximum size.

00:00:45.101 --> 00:00:52.081
The menu at the end of each row offers Rename, Move, Copy, View, Download and Delete.

00:00:52.548 --> 00:00:54.680
Each folder has a menu too.

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:59.527
Create a subfolder adds a folder inside it, and Delete is offered for

00:00:59.527 --> 00:01:01.788
every folder except the root.

